<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ SET ENGLAND 238 TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ SET ENGLAND 238 TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>NAPIER, New Zealand 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand, batting first, scored 237 all out from 49.4 overs on Wednesday in the third one-day cricket international against England.</p>
<p>Score: New Zealand 237 (B. Young 53, C. White 4-37)</p>
